<title>USA: CATTLE-FAX average feedlot cattle prices - Aug 18.</title>
<headline>CATTLE-FAX average feedlot cattle prices - Aug 18.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average prices for feedlot steers in the main U.S. six-state and three-state regions, according to CATTLE-FAX (in dollars per cwt) --</p>
<p>6 STATES -</p>
<p> Friday	    Aug  15  $65.19    up 0.04</p>
<p> Thursday	  Aug  14  $65.15    up 0.03</p>
<p> Wednesday	 Aug  13  $65.12    up 0.10</p>
<p>3 STATES -</p>
<p> Friday	    Aug  15  $64.94    up 0.06</p>
<p> Thursday	  Aug  14  $64.88    up 0.06</p>
<p> Wednesday	 Aug  13  $64.82    up 0.22</p>
<p>Note: 6 states include TX, NE, KS, CO, OK, IA.</p>
<p>	    3 states include TX, KS, OK.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720))</p>
